  "limits": [
    "All gameplay used native CUA keyboard/clicks, the same legitimately earned QA character and normal clocks. Static existing world definitions guided routes. No GM, health, coordinates, identity, assets, production time or resource density edits.",
    "Initial online model delay caused starvation death; closed-door approaches, wrong screen-origin calculation, selector mismatch, native path wall collisions, one rapid-food server rejection and one final-camp transition movement rejection remain in the evidence. Native-phase death also rejected one stale movement packet.",
    "Across all four phases there were9884 movement packets,2 rejected packets,25 corrections,1 action error,0 observer overflow. Reconnect/full-state corrections are included; this is not a zero-correction run.",
    "63 new action requests include62 successful and1 rapid-food rejection. Source5 + new62 =67 handled. No duplicate production request/replay was sent; disappearance of the collect UI after collection is narrower evidence.",
    "Normal60-second production is evidenced by original readyAt, disabled60s initial UI and accepted mature collection, with file timestamps bracketing readyAt. Observer action records do not include an independent per-action wall timestamp.",
    "Potato gave25 satiety at full HP100; HP remained100. The configured3HP heal was capped; no low-health3HP heal was verified.",
    "First audit comparison failed because normal survival tick advanced1042ms between checkpoint and graceful stop, reducing satiety58.6505 to58.39. The audit now verifies the exact0.25/second decay and backup equals actual saved58.39. It does not alter the stored state.",
    "Tools, camp, farm and crop spend all48 wood24 stone2 scrap. Final food1,water4,seed1,axe in bag,pick equipped,potato3. The initial death drop was fully recovered. No free walls, warehouse, workbench or defense was granted.",
    "This is one first-cycle functional route, with ordinary page-close/offline breaks. Harvest gives no seeds; one remaining seed is sufficient seed for only one further cycle, which still requires gathering2wood and2scrap because all carried resources were spent. Not proof of self-sufficiency, newbie pacing or long-run economy balance.",
    "Final page only exported errors[] and all5 slow samples, maxRAF gap83.5ms. Earlier closed pages have no exported frame/error diagnostic collection, so no all-pages error-free or performance conclusion. JS heap alone is not browser total memory.",
    "All owned services/tabs closed and viewport restored. The actual production sdc.sqlite was never opened. Ordinary repository push is not external website deployment.",
    "Map/building variety, further progression/seed supply, paid defensive camps and multiplayer loops, cold ground stalls, strict continuous60seconds, physical presentation, fullP95, GPU and long-session memory remain unaccepted."
  ],
